    dct:bibliographicCitation "Marcus Jowsey et al. (UNECE Team 2024)."@en ;
    dct:creator <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-8434-7325> ;
    dct:description "The Australian Legislation Catalog Example, short-namedndaLawCatalog, is a structured and open-source catalog that refers to RDF datasets generated from Australian Legislation. It was designed to provide an example for research, and could be applied in any applications."@en ;
